Title: MultiMelon Wifi

Summary: 3DS local wireless over WiFi, with MultiMelon and other 3DSes

Description: |
  Carries the game's local wireless (UDS) over your WiFi network,
  so it plays with MultiMelon on a PC and with other 3DSes.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 2MiB
